只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"给 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web 界面加一个 VS Code 风格的工作区文件浏览器：右侧文件树 + 可编辑标签页 + Markdown 阅读/编辑/分屏 + 悬浮大纲 + Quick Open 搜索。","id":"gh:1333943782","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"Dsh-FileExplorer","slug":"bearllfleed/Dsh-FileExplorer","topics":["dsh-plugin","file","file-explorer"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"给 DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web 界面加一个 VS Code 风格的工作区文件浏览器：右侧文件树 + 可编辑标签页 + Markdown 阅读/编辑/分屏 + 悬浮大纲 + Q"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"rness (DSH) Web 界面加一个 VS Code 风格的工作区文件浏览器：右侧文件树 + 可编辑标签页 + Markdown 阅读/编辑/分屏 + 悬浮大纲 + Quick Open 搜索。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-file-explorer"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A VS Code-style workspace file explorer for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web UI: right-side file tree "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"+ editable tabs + Markdown read/edit/split + floating outline + Quick Open."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **File tree**: right-side explorer with type-colored icons and collapsible folders; click a file t"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"o open it in the center area.\n- **Right-click menu**: right-click the file tree → New File / New Fol"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"der / Rename / Delete / Copy Path (like the VS Code explorer).\n- **Drag-and-drop move**: drag a file"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" or folder onto a folder to move it (like VS Code); open tabs update their path automatically when a"},{"id":"p6s5","text":" file is moved.\n- **Import from your OS**: paste files copied in Finder / Windows Explorer (`⌘/Ctrl+"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"V`) or drag them in from the desktop — folders keep their structure and name clashes are auto-rename"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"d.\n- **Editable tabs**: center tabs (after the conversation/trace tabs) with syntax highlighting, Ta"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"b indent, `⌘/Ctrl+S` save, hover `×` close, and a right-click menu (Close / Close Others / Close to "},{"id":"p6s9","text":"the Right / Close Saved / Close All / Copy Path / Pin).\n- **Auto-save**: configurable \"Off / After d"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"elay / On focus lost\"; a confirm dialog guards closing unsaved files.\n- **Markdown**: Typora/Obsidia"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"n-style \"Read / Edit / Split\" modes; a floating outline on the right in read mode that expands on ho"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ver (like ChatGPT's hover bar).\n- **Quick Open**: `⌘/Ctrl+P` fuzzy file search and open (same as VS "},{"id":"p6s13","text":"Code); also reachable via the magnifier button in the sidebar header.\n- **i18n**: switches between C"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"hinese and English by following the DSH general setting.\n- **Editor font**: customize the editor fon"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"t for opened files in the settings panel (monospace contexts).\n- **Open chat files in-app**: clickin"},{"id":"p6s16","text":"g a file in the chat (a produced-file chip, an inline path mention, or a tool card's file link) open"},{"id":"p6s17","text":"s it in the explorer editor tab instead of the browser/Finder."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Explorer expanded**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Explorer collapsed**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**File settings**"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**File search**"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Open file**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Markdown outline**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Closing an unsaved file**"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Requires DSH with an initialized `web` profile (auto-created on first `dsh web`)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"`dsh plugin` is DSH's built-in plugin manager; it forwards the arguments to pnpm inside the profile "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"directory. **Always use it, not `npm install -g`** — DSH loads plugins from `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"node_modules`, and it never reads the global directory (Windows `AppData\\Roaming\\npm`), so a global "},{"id":"p17s4","text":"install has no effect."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> Prerequisite: `dsh plugin` shells out to pnpm, so install pnpm first (`npm install -g pnpm`), othe"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"rwise it fails with `pnpm not found on PATH`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Option 1: install from npm"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Option 2: install from GitHub (no npm publish required)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Update"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Check installed / latest version"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Then enable the plugin"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Installing only adds the package as a dependency; you must also register it in the profile's `cordis"},{"id":"p30s2","text":".patch.yml` so DSH loads it. Edit `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` and add:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`id` is a unique identifier in the config tree (customizable); `name` must be the npm package name."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Restart"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"> After install/update you must **fully quit and restart the `dsh web` process** (host routes are re"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"gistered at startup) and hard-refresh the page with `⌘/Ctrl+Shift+R` (the browser bundle is cached)."},{"id":"p35s3","text":" A plain page refresh won't pick up new features."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### New features don't show up after updating?"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Check in order:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"1. **DSH not fully restarted** — host routes (new file / rename / delete) are registered at process "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"startup; quit `dsh web` and start it again, not just refresh the page.\n2. **Browser cache** — the ri"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ght-click menu and drag-and-drop live in the browser bundle; hard-refresh or use an incognito window"},{"id":"p38s4","text":".\n3. **Wrong location / wrong version** — `dsh plugin --profile web list dsh-plugin-file-explorer` s"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"hows the actually-loaded version; if it's an old one, it was likely installed with `npm install -g` "},{"id":"p38s6","text":"into the global directory (which DSH ignores). Re-run `dsh plugin --profile web add ...` above."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Action | Shortcut / entry |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| Toggle file tree | file icon in the right activity bar |\n| Open a file | click in the tree; or `⌘/"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"Ctrl+P` then Enter |\n| New / rename / delete | right-click menu in the tree |\n| Move a file / folder"},{"id":"p41s3","text":" | drag it onto the target folder |\n| Save | `⌘/Ctrl+S` |\n| Close a tab | hover `×` on the tab, or r"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"ight-click menu |\n| Markdown mode | \"Read / Edit / Split\" at the top of the file |\n| Markdown outlin"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"e | hover the right floating bar in read mode |\n| Editor font / auto-save | gear button in the sideb"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"he right floating bar in read mode |\n| Editor font / auto-save | gear button in the sidebar header |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Layout"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"After editing `lib/`, if the plugin is installed via a `file:` link, sync to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"/node_modules/dsh-plugin-file-explorer/lib/`; otherwise re-run `dsh plugin add` and restart."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
